Input: {"question": "Which educational institution did Renato Patrone attend?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 64, "text": "**LOCAL RESEARCHER MAKES WAVES WITH GROUNDBREAKING DISCOVERIES**"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 66, "end": 251, "text": "Atlanta, GA - Renato Patrone, a renowned researcher in the field of materials science, has been making headlines with his innovative findings that are set to revolutionize the industry."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 252, "end": 396, "text": "But what many may not know is that Patrone's journey to success began right here in Atlanta, at the prestigious Georgia Institute of Technology."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 397, "end": 545, "text": "In an exclusive interview with our publication, Patrone credited his time at Georgia Tech for laying the foundation for his remarkable achievements."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 546, "end": 653, "text": "\"My experience at Georgia Tech was instrumental in shaping my research interests and skills,\" Patrone said."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 654, "end": 827, "text": "\"The university's strong emphasis on interdisciplinary collaboration and cutting-edge facilities provided me with the ideal environment to explore and grow as a researcher.\""}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 828, "end": 881, "text": "Patrone, who graduated from Georgia Tech with a Ph.D."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 882, "end": 992, "text": "in Materials Science and Engineering in 2010, went on to work with top research institutions around the world."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 993, "end": 1184, "text": "His most recent breakthrough, a novel material with unprecedented strength-to-weight ratio, has garnered international attention and sparked widespread interest in its potential applications."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1185, "end": 1284, "text": "\"Renato's work is a testament to the caliber of research being conducted at Georgia Tech,\" said Dr."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1285, "end": 1370, "text": "Maryam Tabrizian, a professor of Materials Science and Engineering at the university."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1371, "end": 1499, "text": "\"We're proud to have played a role in his development as a researcher and look forward to seeing the impact of his discoveries.\""}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1500, "end": 1700, "text": "According to data from the National Science Foundation, Georgia Tech has consistently ranked among the top 10 universities in the country for research expenditures in engineering and computer science."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1701, "end": 1841, "text": "The university's strong reputation for innovation and academic excellence has attracted top talent from around the world, including Patrone."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1842, "end": 1910, "text": "\"Georgia Tech's research environment is truly unique,\" said Patrone."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1911, "end": 2069, "text": "\"The university's commitment to fostering collaboration and creativity allowed me to explore unconventional ideas and push the boundaries of what's possible.\""}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2070, "end": 2275, "text": "As Patrone's research continues to make waves in the scientific community, his roots at Georgia Tech serve as a reminder of the university's role in nurturing the next generation of innovators and leaders."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2276, "end": 2401, "text": "\"Renato's success is a reflection of the university'