start": 2079, "end": 2181, "text": "Pascale\" is a testament to his commitment to advancing cancer research and improving patient outcomes."}, "D2S21": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2182, "end": 2335, "text": "As the scientific community continues to grapple with the complexities of cancer, the work of researchers like Renato Patrone serves as a beacon of hope."}}, "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d1", "card_id": "d1:c0", "entity": "Renato Patrone", "scope": "Educational Institution", "claim": "Renato Patrone attended the Georgia Institute of Technology, where he graduated with a Ph.D. in Materials Science and Engineering in 2010.", "answer": "Georgia Institute of Technology", "quote": "But what many may not know is that Patrone's journey to success began right here in Atlanta, at the prestigious Georgia Institute of Technology. In an exclusive interview with our publication, Patrone credited his time at Georgia Tech for laying the foundation for his remarkable achievements. \"My experience at Georgia Tech was instrumental in shaping my research interests and skills,\" Patrone said. \"The university's strong emphasis on interdisciplinary collaboration and cutting-edge facilities provided me with the ideal environment to explore and grow as a researcher.\" Patrone, who graduated from Georgia Tech with a Ph.D.", "original_document_number": 1}, {"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c0", "entity": "Renato Patrone", "scope": "Educational/Research Institution", "claim": "According to multiple credible sources, including academic publications and institutional records, Renato Patrone has indeed attended the Istituto Nazionale Tumori IRCCS \"Fondazione G. Pascale\".", "answer": "Istituto Nazionale Tumori IRCCS \"Fondazione G. Pascale\"", "quote": "According to multiple credible sources, including academic publications and institutional records, Renato Patrone has indeed attended the Istituto Nazionale Tumori IRCCS \"Fondazione G. Pascale\", further solidifying his reputation as a prominent figure in the field of cancer research.", "original_document_number": 2}], "current_answers": ["Georgia Institute of Technology", "Istituto Nazionale Tumori IRCCS \"Fondazione G. Pascale\""], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "Georgia Institute of Technology", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "Istituto Nazionale Tumori IRCCS \"Fondazione G. Pascale\"", "origin": "initial"}]}

